<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A- rating on Nova Scotia's samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A- rating on Nova Scotia's samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Wednesday it had assigned an A minus (A-) rating to the Province of Nova Scotia's 25 billion yen worth of Australian dollar/yen dual currency samurai bonds due on May 12, 1999.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the outlook of the bonds was negative.</p>
</text>
